{"title": "Astral Step", "pageid": 29833, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral_Step", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Teleportation actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Misty_Step.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Misty_Step.webp/300px-Misty_Step.webp, /w/images/3/30/Misty_Step.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Misty_Step.webp/300px-Misty_Step.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Misty_Step.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>This <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">creature-only</a> action allows its user to teleport to any location within their line of sight without triggering <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attacks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Opportunity Attacks\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSurrounded by silver mist, you teleport to an unoccupied space you can see.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_AstralStep_Githyanki</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AstralStep_Githyanki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AstralStep_Githyanki\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kethk\" title=\"Kethk\">Kethk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ko%27kuu\" title=\"Ko'kuu\">Ko'kuu</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">Ptaris' Mental Image</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sarth_Baretha\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarth Baretha\">Sarth Baretha</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stornugoss\" title=\"Stornugoss\">Stornugoss</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Veteran_Gish\" title=\"Veteran Gish\">Veteran Gish</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">W'wargaz</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Zhendila\" title=\"Zhendila\">Zhendila</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Aside from being a Class Action rather than a spell, and being unbound by spell slots or recharge restrictions, it is otherwise identical to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/38px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/50px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/25px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Step\" title=\"Misty Step\">Misty Step</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040841\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1753/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19172/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6691/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1029824/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.637      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   45.637      1 -total\n 75.51%   34.462     22 Template:Trim\n 24.38%   11.128      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.91%    8.172      1 Template:Resource\n 14.03%    6.401      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.20%    5.566      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.53%    4.807      2 Template:Icon_text\n  9.43%    4.304      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.46%    3.859      1 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:29833-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715040841 and revision id 379420. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}